machs, Items Available, Items Borrowed, Unread Messages), grid changed to `lg:grid-cols-4`.\n\n- **`src/app/page.tsx`**\n    - **Importance:** Landing page with Dockly branding section.\n    - **Changes:** Dockly CTA banner uses orange (`#f97316`) accents, \"Dockly\" with orange \"ly\", promo code `GEMACH2W` in orange badge, teal heading text.\n\n- **`src/components/Sidebar.tsx`**\n    - **Importance:** Navigation sidebar with Items link and Dockly promo.\n    - **Changes:** Added \"Items\" nav item (Package icon), Dockly promo card with orange styling and `GEMACH2W` code.\n\n- **`src/app/dashboard/my-gemachs/page.tsx`**\n    - **Importance:** My Gemachs list with items link per gemach.\n    - **Changes:** Added Package icon button linking to `/dashboard/my-gemachs/[id]/items`, imported Package.\n\n- **`src/app/api/items/route.ts`** (NEW)\n    - **Importance:** Aggregated items API for dashboard.\n    - **Changes:** GET returns all items across user's gemachs with stats (available, lent, returned, total).\n\n- **`src/app/api/gemachs/[id]/items/route.ts`** (NEW)\n    - **Importance:** CRUD for items within a specific gemach.\n    - **Changes:** GET lists items, POST creates with auto-generated UUID QR code (owner-only).\n\n- **`src/app/api/items/[id]/route.ts`** (NEW)\n    - **Importance:** Single item CRUD.\n    - **Changes:** GET with gemach include, PUT (owner-only), DELETE (owner-only).\n\n- **`src/app/dashboard/my-gemachs/[id]/items/page.tsx`** (NEW)\n    - **Importance:** Item management page per gemach.\n    - **Changes:** Add item form, QR code preview per item, status badges, delete with optimistic UI, download QR PNG, scan page link.\n\n#### **Errors and Fixes**\n\n- **`@/components/Spinner` module not found:** No Spinner component existed. Fixed by using inline `<Loader2 className=\"h-8 w-8 animate-spin\" />` from lucide-react.\n- **EmptyState `onClick` type error:** EmptyState's action prop only supported `{ label, href }`. Fixed by replacing with inline 